{"hw":"ἀλήθεια","html":"<div class=\"lex-entry\"><h4 class=\"lex-hw gk\">ἀλήθεια</h4><span class=\"lex-orth gk\">ἀλήθ-εια</span> [<span class=\"gk\">αλ], <span class=\"lex-gram\">ἡ</span> </span>, <span class=\"lex-gram\"> <span class=\"lex-gram\">Dor.</span> </span> <span class=\"lex-orth gk\">ἀλάθεια</span> (also <div class=\"lex-sense\" data-level=\"1\"><span class=\"lex-n\">A</span> <span class=\"gk\">ἀλαθεία</span> <span class=\"lex-cite\"> <span class=\"lex-cite-author\">B.</span> <span class=\"lex-cite-scope\">12.204</span> </span> ); <span class=\"gk\">ἀλάθεα</span> <span class=\"lex-cite\"> <span class=\"lex-cite-author\">Alc.</span> <span class=\"lex-cite-scope\">57</span> </span>, <span class=\"lex-cite\"> <span class=\"lex-cite-author\">Theoc.</span> <span class=\"lex-cite-scope\">29.1</span> </span> is neut. pl. of <span class=\"gk\">ἀλαθής</span>; <span class=\"lex-gram\"> <span class=\"lex-gram\">Ep.</span> </span> (and Farly <span class=\"lex-gram\"> <span class=\"lex-gram\">Att.</span> </span> acc. to Hdn.Gr.<span class=\"lex-cite\"> <span class=\"lex-cite-scope\">2.454</span> </span>) <span class=\"lex-orth gk\">ἀληθεία;</span> <span class=\"lex-gram\"> <span class=\"lex-gram\">Ion.</span> </span> <span class=\"lex-orth gk\">ἀληθείη</span>: </div> <div class=\"lex-sense\" data-level=\"2\"><span class=\"lex-n\">I</span> <b class=\"lex-tr\">truth</b>, opp. <b class=\"lex-tr\">lie</b> or <b class=\"lex-tr\">mere appearance</b>: </div> <div class=\"lex-sense\" data-level=\"3\"><span class=\"lex-n\">1</span> in <span class=\"lex-cite\"> <span class=\"lex-cite-author\">Hom.</span> </span> only opp. <b class=\"lex-tr\">a lie</b>, freq. in phrase <span class=\"gk\">ἀληθείην καταλέξαι</span> <span class=\"lex-cite\"> <span class=\"lex-cite-author\">Il.</span> <span class=\"lex-cite-scope\">24.407</span> </span>,al.; <span class=\"gk\">ἀ. ἀποειπεῖν</span> <span class=\"lex-cite\"> <span class=\"lex-cite-scope\">23.361</span> </span>; <span class=\"gk\">παιδὸ