.</span> <span class=\"lex-cite-scope\">2.41</span> </span>; <span class=\"gk\">μιμήματα ἀληθείας</span> <span class=\"lex-cite\"> <span class=\"lex-cite-author\">Pl.</span> <cite class=\"lex-cite-title\">Plt.</cite> <span class=\"lex-cite-scope\">300c</span> </span>:— in adverb. usages, <span class=\"gk\">τῇ ἀ.</span> <b class=\"lex-tr\">in very truth</b>, <span class=\"lex-cite\"> <span class=\"lex-cite-author\">Th.</span> <span class=\"lex-cite-scope\">4.120</span> </span>, etc.; <span class=\"gk\">ταῖς ἀ.</span> <span class=\"lex-cite\"> <span class=\"lex-cite-author\">Isoc.</span> <span class=\"lex-cite-scope\">15.283</span> </span>, cf. <span class=\"lex-cite\"> <span class=\"lex-cite-author\">Philem.</span> <span class=\"lex-cite-scope\">130</span> </span>, <span class=\"lex-cite\"> <span class=\"lex-cite-author\">Plb.</span> <span class=\"lex-cite-scope\">10.40.5</span> </span>, <span class=\"lex-cite\"> <span class=\"lex-cite-author\">Babr.</span> <span class=\"lex-cite-scope\">75.20</span> </span>; rarely (without the Art.) <span class=\"gk\">ἀληθείᾳ</span> <span class=\"lex-cite\"> <span class=\"lex-cite-author\">Pl.</span> <cite class=\"lex-cite-title\">Prt.</cite> <span class=\"lex-cite-scope\">343d</span> </span>:—with Preps., <span class=\"gk\">ἐν τῇ ἀ.</span> <span class=\"lex-cite\"> <span class=\"lex-cite-author\">Pl.</span> <cite class=\"lex-cite-title\">La.</cite> <span class=\"lex-cite-scope\">183d</span> </span>; <span class=\"gk\">ἐπὶ τῆς ἀληθείας καὶ τοῦ πράγματος</span> <b class=\"lex-tr\">in truth and reality</b>, <span class=\"lex-cite\"> <span class=\"lex-cite-author\">D.</span> <span class=\"lex-cite-scope\">21.72</span> </span>; <span class=\"gk\">ἐπ' ἀληθείᾳ</span> <b class=\"lex-tr\">for the sake of truth</b>, <span class=\"lex-cite\"> <span class=\"lex-cite-author\">A.</span> <cite class=\"lex-cite-title\">Supp.</cite> <span class=\"lex-cite-scope\">628</span> </span>, <span class=\"lex-cite\"> <span class=\"lex-cite-author\">Ar.</sp